Cell["\<\
The internal projector is applied to each site-diagonal Green block, and the \
contributions are summed over device sites.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1496710216,ExpressionUUID->"cb44f871-729a-594d-8ec5-cee55ff21b0d"],

Cell["\<\
The shortest form uses the lead onsite block as the device Hamiltonian.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->191698548,ExpressionUUID->"03f12cab-af56-0f4d-8e19-1840176008f8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The default ",
